          "briefTitle": "PBF-1129 and Nivolumab for the Treatment of Recurrent or Metastatic Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer",
          "officialTitle": "A Phase Ib Trial of PBF-1129 and Nivolumab in Patients With Advanced Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer"
        },
        "statusModule": {
