        "descriptionModule": {
          "briefSummary": "A phase I study to evaluate the safety, tolerability, pharmacokinetics and preliminary efficacy of TGRX-1942 in patients with advanced solid tumor and/or relapsed or refractory hematological malignancies",
          "detailedDescription": "This study is designed as a three-part study, with dose escalation, dose expansion and indication expansion phases. Patients with advanced solid tumors will be initially enrolled to the study. Other indications including solid tumors with specific gene mutations, or other hematological malignancies with be considered for expansion phases, with appropriate doses as evaluated at the end of dose escalation phase."
        },
