              "timeFrame": "On day 1-6 of the single dosing phase; patient will only be dosed once on Day 1 of this phase"
            },
            {
              "measure": "Steady State Time to Maximal Concentration (Tmax,ss)",
              "description": "Under once daily dosing schedule, to measure the time to reach maximum plasma drug concentration between two dosing timepoints",
              "timeFrame": "On day 1 of Cycle 1 of dose escalation phase (each cycle is 28 days)"
            },
            {
              "measure": "Steady State Maximal Concentration (Cmax,ss)",
              "description": "Under once daily dosing schedule, to measure the maximal plasma drug concentration from first dosing",
