              "description": "TTR (that is, time to first response) based on INV is defined as the time from the first dose of study treatment to the date of first documentation of a response (PR or CR) prior to any disease progression and subsequent anticancer therapy, based on RECIST version 1.1., for participants who have PR or CR as their best response.",
