          "officialTitle": "Pioneering Pre- and Post-Operative Integrative Care to Improve Thoracic Cancer Quality of Care - The Thoracic Peri-Operative Integrative Surgical Care Evaluation (POISE) Trial - Stage III",
          "acronym": "POISE"
        },
        "statusModule": {
