          "briefTitle": "Hypnosis on Breathlessness Mastery in Patients With Persistent Dyspnea",
          "officialTitle": "Effectiveness of Hypnosis on Breathlessness Mastery in Patients With Persistent Dyspnea: a Randomised Controlled Trial",
          "acronym": "HYPNEA"
        },
        "statusModule": {
