          "briefTitle": "EZH2 Inhibitor, Tulmimetostat, and PD-1 Blockade for Treatment of Advanced Non-small Cell Lung Cancer",
          "officialTitle": "Phase Ib/II Study of Safety and Efficacy of EZH2 Inhibitor, Tulmimetostat, and PD-1 Blockade for Treatment of Advanced Non-small Cell Lung Cancer"
        },
        "statusModule": {
          "statusVerifiedDate": "2026-01",
