            {
              "label": "Prostate Cancer",
              "description": "Adults suitable for radical image-guided radiotherapy for their Prostate cancer, approximately 170 patients Components from RTOG, LENT SOM(A), RMH symptom scale and UCLA PCI (prostate cancer index) questionnaires will be used.",
              "interventionNames": [
