              "interventionNames": [
                "Radiation: Radical Image-Guided Radiotherapy"
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "Central Nervous System Tumours",
              "description": "Adults suitable for radical image-guided radiotherapy for their CNS tumour, as many patients recruited as possible. Components from RTOG, LENT SOM(A), Folstein mini mental state examination \\& Generalised activites of daily living scale (G-ADL) questionnaires will be used.",
              "interventionNames": [
