            "OLDER_ADULT"
          ],
          "studyPopulation": "Adults suitable for radical image-guided radiotherapy with Prostate, Head \\& Neck, Brain, or Lung Cancer. The variation in conditions is based on the requirements of Machine Learning algorithms requiring high levels of clinical applicability, which depends on the quality and quantity of the input data available. The input data set therefore should adequately encompass the variation in anatomy encountered in the population.",
