          "briefTitle": "A Prospective Phase II Study of Postoperative Concurrent Chemoradiotherapy in Patients With Intrahepatic Cholangiocarcinoma",
          "officialTitle": "A Prospective Phase II Study of Adjuvant Concurrent Chemoradiotherapy With Simultaneous Integrated Boost Following Hepatectomy for Intrahepatic Cholangiocarcinoma With Narrow Margin or Nodal Involvement"
        },
        "statusModule": {
