          "briefTitle": "Oral Magnesium Supplementation in Athletes With Premature Ventricular Contractions or Premature Atrial Contractions.",
          "officialTitle": "Oral Magnesium Supplementation in Athletes With Premature Ventricular Contractions or Premature Atrial Contractions."
        },
