          "briefTitle": "Sedentarism of Stroke Survivors in the Valencian Community and Development of a Self-management Program",
          "officialTitle": "Assessment of the Level of Physical Activity and Sedentarism of Stroke Survivors in the Valencian Community and Development of a Specific Self-management Program",
          "acronym": "SEDMA_Stroke"
        },
        "statusModule": {
