              "timeFrame": "Change from baseline in weight at 6 months"
            },
            {
              "measure": "Change in waist and hip circumference during 6 months evaluated by an anthropometric tape following the ISAK protocol.",
              "description": "The waist and hip circumference are measured following the ISAK protocol and measurement technique with an anthropometric tape (Holtain).",
              "timeFrame": "Change from baseline in waist and hip circumference at 6 months"
            },
            {
              "measure": "Change in height jump during 6 months evaluated by countermovement jump test",
