          "briefTitle": "Health Parameters in Soccer Players and Sedentary Individuals After Consuming a Synbiotic",
          "officialTitle": "Differential Health Effects on Inflammatory, Immunological and Stress Parameters in Professional Soccer Players and Sed-entary Individuals After Consuming a Synbiotic. A Triple Blind-ed, Randomized, Placebo-controlled Pilot Study"
        },
        "statusModule": {
