          "briefTitle": "A Collaborative Theory-based Intervention to Promote Physical Activity Among Sedentary Parents and Their Children",
          "officialTitle": "A Collaborative Theory-based Intervention to Promote Physical Activity Among Sedentary Parents and Their Children",
          "acronym": "ProAct"
        },
        "statusModule": {
