          "officialTitle": "Non Invasive Measurement of the Haemodynamic Parameters and of the Advanced Glycation End Products (AGEs) Levels in Students Smokers and in Students Who Intake Caffeine (NONINVASHAEMOAGES)",
          "acronym": "NONINVASHEMO"
