              "label": "Cognitive-Behavioral Counseling (CBC)",
              "type": "EXPERIMENTAL",
              "description": "Cognitive-Behavioral Counseling (CBC) consists of two 45-minute on-site intervention sessions (session 1 and 3), one 15 minute on-site session (session 2), and one 15-minutes phone session (booster session).",
              "interventionNames": [
