        "baselineCharacteristicsModule": {
          "populationDescription": "Eligible caregivers had to be the parent or legal guardian of a child aged 6 months to 6 years, who reported one or more smokers living in the home, and who spoke English. The enrolled caregiver did not have to be the smoker.",
