        "descriptionModule": {
          "briefSummary": "The specific objectives of this study are to investigate the (1) feasibility, (2) preliminary effectiveness and (3) effect sizes of the integrated smoking cessation and alcohol intervention when compared to standalone smoking cessation (ST) and control among young adults in Hong Kong."
        },
        "conditionsModule": {
