              "pmid": "25103183",
              "type": "BACKGROUND",
              "citation": "Ybarra ML, Holtrop JS, Prescott TL, Strong D. Process evaluation of a mHealth program: lessons learned from Stop My Smoking USA, a text messaging-based smoking cessation program for young adults. Patient Educ Couns. 2014 Nov;97(2):239-43. doi: 10.1016/j.pec.2014.07.009. Epub 2014 Jul 17."
            },
            {
              "pmid": "24766267",
