              "citation": "Ybarra ML, Prescott TL, Holtrop JS. Steps in tailoring a text messaging-based smoking cessation program for young adults. J Health Commun. 2014 Dec;19(12):1393-407. doi: 10.1080/10810730.2014.901441. Epub 2014 Apr 25."
            },
