The study that satisfies all the conditions is **NCT05627765 – “An Integrated Smoking Cessation and Alcohol Intervention for Young People.”** It was completed in 2022, its main institution is recorded as **The Hong Kong Polytechnic University**, and its title translated into Spanish is:

**Intervención integrada para dejar de fumar y consumo de alcohol en jóvenes.**"}]

