          "officialTitle": "A Phase 1, Open-Label, Randomized, Single Dose, Parallel Design Study To Estimate The Relative Bioavailability Of Co Administered Formulations Of Azithromycin Microsphere (AZ) And Chloroquine Test Formulation (CQ) Compared With Co Administered Immediate Release Individual AZ And CQ Tablets In Healthy Adult Subjects",
