          "briefTitle": "Zinc Supplementation to Reduce Diarrhea Rates in Adults in Western Kenya.",
          "officialTitle": "A Randomized, Double Blind, Controlled Study to Determine the Efficacy of Zinc Supplementation on Diarrhea Incidence in an Adult Population in Western Kenya."
        },
