              "populationDescription": "The Full Analysis Set (FAS) consisted of all subjects with evaluable baseline and post-baseline values of generalized tonic-clonic (GTC) seizure frequency as the efficacy analysis, excluding those patients who seriously violated Good Clinical Practice (GCP).",
