          "briefTitle": "LEvetiracetam to Prevent Seizures in Symptomatic Alzheimer's Disease in Adults With Down Syndrome",
          "officialTitle": "A Phase III, Randomized, Double-blinded Study of the Efficacy and Safety of LEvetiracetam to Prevent Seizures in Symptomatic Alzheimer's Disease in Adults With Down Syndrome (the LESS-AD Trial).",
