          "briefTitle": "R33: Levetiracetam in Early Psychosis",
          "officialTitle": "A 12-week Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled Trial Investigating the Effects of Levetiracetam in Early Psychosis"
        },
        "statusModule": {
