          "officialTitle": "A Multicenter, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled, Parallel Group Study of the Safety and Efficacy of Levetiracetam in the Adjunctive Treatment of Adult Female Subjects (18 to 40 Years of Age) With C1 Catamenial Epilepsy"
        },
