                  "groupIds": [
                    "OG000"
                  ],
                  "groupDescription": "Analyses of the primary efficacy variable will be descriptive only. No hypothesis tests are planned.\n\nThe number and percentage of subjects remaining in the study through the 21-Week Treatment Period will be calculated. Subjects with retention will be counted in the numerator. All subjects in the relevant population will be used as the denominator.\n\nThis percentage will be known as the retention rate, along with the 95 % confidence interval based on the normal approximation.",
