              "description": "The following principals implemented while online learning will be processing;\n\n1. Address and consider the students' differences in online learning application as a new experience.\n2. Allow for Individual Locus of Control.\n3. Motivate the student:\n4. Avoid information overload,\n5. Create A real-life context,\n6. Encourage social interaction,\n7. Provide hands-on activities,\n8. Encourage student reflection.",
              "interventionNames": [
